          "rule": "For \"to be\" questions, put the question word first, then \"is\" or \"are,\" then the subject: What is your name? Where are you from? How old are you? For questions about actions or routines, use \"do\": What do you do?",
          "examples": [
            "What is your name?",
            "Where are you from?",
            "How old are you?",
            "What do you do?"
